<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: '"Source Han Sans SC","Microsoft YaHei",Arial,sans-serif' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 72, background: '#1E4FA8', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>延伸二：用 0.008 的干净精度，买 0.40 的鲁棒 AUC</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#C7D8F2' }}>13 · Robustness</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', paddingLeft: 60, paddingRight: 60, paddingTop: 22, paddingBottom: 54 }}>
        <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
            <Image src='assets/adv.png' style={{ width: 900, height: 348, objectFit: 'contain' }} />
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', textAlign: 'center', marginTop: 2 }}>
            图：figures/fgsm_adv_compare.png，左 AUC 右 ACC，虚线是训练时用的 ε=0.03；阴影为 3 个 seed 的标准差
        </Text>

        <Box style={{ marginTop: 10, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 362, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Box style={{ display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 48, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>0.47 → 0.87</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>
                    ε=0.03 处 AUC，崩溃被填掉 79%；ACC 同点 0.48 → 0.80。
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 362, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 48, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F', lineHeight: 1 }}>−0.0081</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>
                    干净 AUC 的代价（0.9886 → 0.9805）；3 个 seed 配对方向全部一致。
                </Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ width: 362, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 48, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>ε ≈ 0.08</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>
                    保护范围的上界；ε≥0.2 时两组都归零，说明只护住同强度邻域。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1 }} />

        <Box style={{ height: 52, background: '#E8EFF8', display: 'flex', alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 18, paddingRight: 18 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230' }}>
                所以「99% 准确率」必须附带扰动假设；<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>0.9886 与 0.9805 的差别，是后者扛得住 1.5% 像素扰动、前者扛不住</span>。
            </Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 670, left: 60, width: 1160, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>MedMNIST 医学影像分类调参实验室 · 中期验收</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>13 / 15</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
